      "claim": "JNJ-39220675, a close analogue sharing the pyridine carboxamide, biaryl ether, and N-cyclopentyl basic amine motif, showed an average brain-to-plasma ratio of 3.4 in rats after subcutaneous dosing, demonstrating meaningful CNS access despite a basic amine and potential efflux liability.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
